  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\mathrm{i}=\\frac{100}{1000}=0.1 \\mathrm{~A}$\n$V_L=V_C=\\frac{0.1}{200 \\times 2 \\times 10^{-6}}=250 \\mathrm{~V}$",
